{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_01_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_01","title":"火山製造","storyCode":"OF-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"786b707c6b02394116fb258dbc589672dcd75c205b792ec494dcde30a6652b7b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"前往火山腳下實地考察的天火和普羅旺斯認為火山有些異常。\n不過，沒等她們進一步判斷，就聽到了求救聲。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"普羅旺斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"普羅旺斯，我真的真的不能把這裡燒乾淨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"這些長得毫無意義的樹枝和草實在是太礙事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這已經是一小時內你第十次抱怨了，天火大小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"本來我就只是想來驗證一下我的疑惑而已，順便幫艾雅法拉小姐收集一些樣本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你自己提出要一起來實地勘察的，要是實在忍受不了這裡的生態環境的話，也不用強忍著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"現在大家應該都在海邊玩，你直接回去和大家匯合就好，你完全不用跟我來受這種罪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我才不放心你這麼亂來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有你這樣的天災信使在，只有以我的知識儲備，才能保證火焰環境下的你們不出什麼意外狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，萬一反而在山上引起大火就不妙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我知道你能應付那種情況......這一次我們畢竟只是來度假的，還是不要引起什麼混亂比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"否則到時候又要給博士他們添麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看在博士和阿米婭的面子上，忍耐一下也沒什麼問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，那邊有一堆黑色的石頭你看到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是黑曜石什麼的，我過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"小心一點，別在這一帶亂跑。尤其是不要隨意用火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......應付這位小姐可比實地勘察要累多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，真奇怪......即使是夏天，這裡的氣溫......也有些反常。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"大尾巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，大尾巴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？欸，你是在叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你從剛才起有聞到什麼奇怪的味道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說的話，的確有點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。很微弱，但是我敢肯定不是錯覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"火山氣體排出的量比我想像中要多，而且艾雅法拉交給我的檢測符文也已經有反應了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去不用我做什麼，搞不好再過一段時間，這裡就自然會變成一片火海哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"這座火山的確有可能有問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"但是更多的我們只能向艾雅法拉小姐求證了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊，岩壁上還有些樣本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"好，這些就夠了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"樣品資料可以用臨時的儀器做點檢測，然後發回羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"艾雅法拉那一頭應該會最快作出後續資料分析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"可是從這些黑曜石的觸感看來......我也不知道，這裡的黑曜石感覺有點特殊，不像是普通的黑曜石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"加上剛才聞到的那股味道以及這裡的氣溫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也不確定，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想說什麼，支支吾吾的，乾脆一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來啊！不過是幾個蟲子而已！看我就在這裡把你們都收拾掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，裙子的下擺卡住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有、有沒有人在這附近啊！為什麼這裡的源石蟲會聚集這麼多啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不要過來啊！誰來幫幫我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"是求救聲！海灘那邊傳來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我們快過去看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，等等我啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普羅旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["天火"]}]}
